{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ksPdK9LGHx1792770452.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>接連有新聞機構及圖書館接獲粉末信，警方指經檢查，相信粉末無爆炸危險。</p><p></p><p>警方指周二至周四接獲四宗報案，指有圖書館及新聞媒體收到可疑信件，信內載有白色粉末。爆炸品處理課人員到場檢查後，相信粉末無爆炸危險，已檢走相關粉末檢驗，暫時將案件列作發現可疑物品案處理。</p><p></p><p>周二起多間新聞媒體接獲由英國寄出，藏有白色粉末的可疑信件。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.347533+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:58:16.302266+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:17.198886+00:00","content_hash":"c4c6d4f8d9a2a9a4b8904bcf0fedc1a24604bb0910c689e2bbe12e87f4851d01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.347533+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}